摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Native local Taskboard plugin for DeepSeek Harness. SQLite-backed projects, Agent claim/review, and a native Web UI — no iframe, no second chat runtime.","id":"gh:1333732838","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"DSH-taskboard","slug":"shengsheng90/DSH-taskboard","topics":["agent","cordis","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","task-management","taskboard"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Native local Taskboard plugin for DeepSeek Harness. SQLite-backed projects, Agent claim/review, and "},{"id":"p1s2","text":"a native Web UI — no iframe, no second chat runtime."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# DSH Taskboard"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 简体中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Native, local project task management for DeepSeek Harness. SQLite is the sole task authority. Harne"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"ss Agent Sessions, Goals, Workspaces, tools, permissions, and the Web Client remain the execution an"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"d conversation owners."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"This README is written so a human **or another coding agent** can install the plugin into a live Har"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"ness profile, verify it, and start using it without guessing."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"**Package:** `@shengsheng/dsh-taskboard`\n**Repository:** https://github.com/shengsheng90/DSH-taskboa"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"rd\n**License:** Apache-2.0\n**Host version policy:** DSH runtime peers use `*` (no version gate). Ins"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"tallation/loading is tested against `0.1.6-alpha.1`, `0.1.7-rc.1/rc.2`, `0.2.0-rc.1/rc.2`, and `0.2."},{"id":"p6s4","text":"1-rc.2`. This verifies installation and module loading; GUI operations and model execution still nee"},{"id":"p6s5","text":"d checking after a Host upgrade."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"If you are an installing agent, jump to Install into DeepSeek Harness and follow every step in order"},{"id":"p7s2","text":". Git, npm, and release tarballs carry prebuilt Host/Client artifacts. Installation requires neither"},{"id":"p7s3","text":" a TypeScript build nor a Harness source checkout."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## What you get"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"After a successful install, Harness gains:"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"- A **Taskboard** sidebar button and a native overlay page (not an iframe, not a second chat runtime"},{"id":"p10s2","text":")\n- Local SQLite projects, tasks, comments, relations, attachments, workflows, and automation\n- Stab"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"le readable keys such as `DSH-42` plus opaque ids and optimistic versions\n- Seven statuses: `backlog"},{"id":"p10s4","text":"` → `todo` → `in_progress` → `in_review` → `done`, plus `blocked` and `canceled`\n- In-process Agent "},{"id":"p10s5","text":"tools `taskboard_*` (no accept / no generic status mutation)\n- Headless JSON CLI `dsh-taskboard`\n- P"},{"id":"p10s6","text":"ackaged Skill `manage-taskboard`"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Agents can submit verified work to `in_review`. Only an authenticated human UI or CLI operation can "},{"id":"p11s2","text":"accept it as `done`."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"Further design docs: Architecture, Security and recovery, CLI reference, Acceptance audit. Attributi"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"on shipped to package consumers is in `THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md`."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## Requirements"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"| Requirement | Value |"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"| Node.js | `^22.19.0` or `>=24.0.0` (24 recommended; built-in `node:sqlite`) |\n| pnpm | Use `11.15."},{"id":"p15s2","text":"1` for repository development (`packageManager`); profile installation uses Harness's pnpm |\n| DeepS"},{"id":"p15s3","text":"eek Harness | checkout or installation, **web** profile; no DSH version constraint |\n| Network | onl"},{"id":"p15s4","text":"y needed to clone this repo and install Node dependencies |\n| Permissions | write access to `$DSH_HO"},{"id":"p15s5","text":"ME` (default `~/.dsh`) and the ability to restart the Harness process |"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Confirm the toolchain before installing:"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## Install into DeepSeek Harness"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Use these constants. Read live values from disk; do not invent a different package name."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"| Name | Value |"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"| Package name | `@shengsheng/dsh-taskboard` |\n| Default profile | `web` |\n| Default Web port | `308"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"0` (detect; do not assume) |\n| Profile directory | `$DSH_HOME/profiles/<profile>` , usually `~/.dsh/"},{"id":"p21s3","text":"profiles/web` |\n| Packed tarball name | `shengsheng-dsh-taskboard-<version>.tgz` |"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"`<version>` is whatever this repo's `package.json` currently declares — read it there rather than co"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"pying a number out of this document. After `pnpm pack`, use the tarball that was actually written."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"A longer copy-paste prompt for a Harness-side agent is in docs/install-plugin-prompt.zh.md. The step"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"s below are the normative English procedure."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"### 1. Detect the running Harness"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"Find the Web listener and its working directory:"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"If nothing is listening on `3080`, search other common ports or ask the operator for the URL they us"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"e (`http://127.0.0.1:<port>`)."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"Set `PORT` to the actual listener port and keep using that value below. Use the running Host's `DSH_"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"HOME` and profile; the examples use profile `web`."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"Decide how to invoke the `dsh` CLI:"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"- If the Harness cwd is a source checkout (repo root has `pnpm-workspace.yaml` and `package.json` co"},{"id":"p30s2","text":"ntains a `\"dsh\"` script), run every later command from that checkout root as `pnpm dsh ...`.\n- Else "},{"id":"p30s3","text":"if `command -v dsh` succeeds, use `dsh ...` directly."},{"id":"p31s1","text":"In the commands below, `dsh` means whichever of those two forms you just chose. First use of a profi"},{"id":"p31s2","text":"le may initialize it and install `@deepseek-ai/dsh-base`."},{"id":"p32s1","text":"### 2. Choose a prebuilt installation source"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"Use npm, Git (which includes `lib/`), or a GitHub release `.tgz`:"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"For the local tarball path in step 3, download a release `.tgz` and record its absolute path. Develo"},{"id":"p35s2","text":"pers changing source run `pnpm install --frozen-lockfile && pnpm build && pnpm pack:release`. Consum"},{"id":"p35s3","text":"er installation does not run a build. Release checks and CI validate completeness, source freshness,"},{"id":"p35s4","text":" and compatibility. See distribution and compatibility strategy for the verification boundaries."},{"id":"p36s1","text":"### 3. Add the plugin to the profile"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"The profile directory is a pnpm workspace root (`packages: [.]`). The `-w` / workspace-root flag is "},{"id":"p37s2","text":"**mandatory**. Without it, pnpm fails with `ERR_PNPM_ADDING_TO_ROOT`."},{"id":"p38s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"If you already installed through npm or Git in step 2, skip this step and continue to composition ve"},{"id":"p39s2","text":"rification. Rebuild and run `pnpm verify:package` before installing a source checkout with local cha"},{"id":"p39s3","text":"ation. Rebuild and run `pnpm verify:package` before installing a source checkout with local changes."},{"id":"p40s1","text":"This command may rewrite the profile `package.json`, lockfile, and `node_modules`. That is expected."},{"id":"p41s1","text":"Install succeeded only when **all** of the following are true:"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"1. `$DSH_HOME/profiles/web/package.json` `dependencies` contains `@shengsheng/dsh-taskboard`.\n2. The"},{"id":"p42s2","text":" same file's `dsh.profile.bundles` lists `@shengsheng/dsh-taskboard` **after** `@deepseek-ai/dsh-bas"},{"id":"p42s3","text":"e`.\n3. `$DSH_HOME/profiles/web/node_modules/@shengsheng/dsh-taskboard/` exists and contains `lib/` p"},{"id":"p42s4","text":"lus `cordis.patch.yml`."},{"id":"p43s1","text":"If the CLI warns `declares no dsh.bundle`, the package is missing `\"dsh\": { \"bundle\": { \"patch\": \"./"},{"id":"p43s2","text":"cordis.patch.yml\" } }` in `package.json`. This repository already declares that; rebuild and reinsta"},{"id":"p43s3","text":"ll rather than editing the installed copy by hand."},{"id":"p44s1","text":"### 4. Verify composition (does not start the server)"},{"id":"p45s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p46s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
